      "description": "Launch an owned agent; completion establishes a composition handle, not task completion. Address optionally sets up a managed Carrier inbox; null or omission leaves it absent. cwd/instructions null or omission use SDK defaults. Setup failures retain launch identity and uncertain-effect details. Cleanup detaches unless stop-owned is configured. Failures stop execution, are never retried, and cancellation does not roll back effects. MCP selection customizes this launch without changing the profile."
    },
    {
