        "timeout": {
          "type": {
            "kind": "number",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "required": false,
          "description": "Seconds. Omission or null uses the connection's configured timeout."
        }
      },
      "outputs": {
        "receipt": {
          "type": {
            "kind": "opaque",
            "id": "aixand.input_receipt",
            "version": "1"
          }
        }
      },
      "description": "Submit nonempty text after input readiness. Success confirms terminal delivery only. Updates the shared handle latest direct-send boundary only when the receipt has an observation revision. Timeout null/omission uses scope timeout. Failed or cancelled delivery can be uncertain. Failures stop execution, are never retried, and cancellation does not roll back effects."
    },
    {
      "id": "aixand.agent.wait",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "inputs": {
        "agent": {
          "type": {
            "kind": "opaque",
            "id": "aixand.agent",
            "version": "1"
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "after": {
          "type": {
            "kind": "opaque",
            "id": "aixand.input_receipt",
            "version": "1",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "required": false
        },
        "stable_for": {
          "type": {
            "kind": "number",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "required": false
        },
        "timeout": {
          "type": {
            "kind": "number",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "required": false,
          "description": "Seconds. Omission or null uses the connection's configured timeout."
        }
      },
      "outputs": {
        "observation": {
          "type": {
            "kind": "object",
            "properties": {
              "session_id": {
                "kind": "string"
              },
              "name": {
                "kind": "string"
              },
              "revision": {
                "kind": "integer"
              },
              "lifecycle": {
                "kind": "string"
              },
              "execution": {
                "kind": "string"
              },
              "interaction": {
                "kind": "string"
              },
              "constraint": {
                "kind": "string"
              },
              "health": {
                "kind": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "session_id",
              "name",
              "revision",
              "lifecycle",
              "execution",
              "interaction",
              "constraint",
              "health"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "description": "Observe stable readiness, never infer task success. Omitted after uses latest eligible direct-send receipt; null observes current readiness; explicit receipt must have a revision and belong to the agent session. Carrier deliveries do not retarget this boundary. stable_for null/omission uses connection configuration. Read-only timeout is a failure. Failures stop execution, are never retried, and cancellation does not roll back effects."
    },
    {
      "id": "aixand.agent.stop",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "inputs": {
        "agent": {
          "type": {
            "kind": "opaque",
            "id": "aixand.agent",
            "version": "1"
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "force": {
          "type": {
            "kind": "boolean"
          },
          "required": false,
          "default": false
        }
      },
      "outputs": {},
      "description": "Stop this agent explicitly, including an attached agent when requested. Closes its consumer and cancels pending input. Success confirms SDK stop completion. Stop failure/cancellation can leave process state uncertain. Failures stop execution, are never retried, and cancellation does not roll back effects."
    },
