      "description": "Store ordinary text to an explicit recipient. Does not decode JSON or await substantive reply. Omitted/null reply_to means uncorrelated; omitted/null key supplies no idempotency guarantee. No implicit acknowledgment. Transport failure may leave delivery uncertain. Failures stop execution, are never retried, and cancellation does not roll back effects."
    },
    {
      "id": "carrier.message.wait_for_reply",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "inputs": {
        "mailbox": {
          "type": {
