      "description": "Wait for pending mailbox messages; timeout is successful status timeout with empty arrays. Timeout and poll interval are positive; limit is 1..100. Omitted/null reply_to applies no correlation filter. No automatic acknowledgment. Service/consumer errors are failures. Failures stop execution, are never retried, and cancellation does not roll back effects."
    },
