      "description": "Reply to a received message using its receiving identity and numeric correlation. Does not acknowledge the original. Null/omitted idempotency key supplies no retry identity. Transport failure may leave effects uncertain. Failures stop execution, are never retried, and cancellation does not roll back effects."
    },
